ous estrogen and postmenopausal breast cancer: a quantitative review</article-title><source>Cancer Causes Control</source><year>1997</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>922</fpage><lpage>928</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Causes Control||8|922||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9427435</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Woods</surname><given-names>MN</given-names></name><name><surname>Barnett</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Spiegelman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Trail</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Hertzmark</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Longcope</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Gorbach</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Hormone levels during dietary changes in premenopausal African-American women</article-title><source>J Natl Cancer Inst</source><year>1996</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>1369</fpage><lpage>1374</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Natl Cancer Inst||88|1369||bib23|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8827014</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>